          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "side c",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>of which the advanced portion is so much; and so</li>\n<li>much will be postponed, incumbent upon him.</li>\n<li>He has (already) paid to her so many</li>\n<li>dinars of her advanced portion, for so</li>\n<li>did they declare to her \u27e6that the advanced portion\u27e7 \\\\in our presence,//</li>\n<li>viz. that they had collected it from his hand.</li>\n<li>And he acquired her as wife and mother</li>\n<li>of children, according to the Torah and the law.</li>\n<li>There remain incumbent upon him so many</li>\n<li>dinars, a strong, firm debt.</li>\n<li>And these are what she brought in with her</li>\n<li>from the house of her fathers. And some</li>\n<li>say, \"You are betrothed to me and (you are) mequddeshet</li>\n<li>to me, you X, daughter of X, by this</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
